  "releaseNotes": "- `SimpleObservable` takes no lock: subscribing and disposing a subscription swap in a new immutable array of subscribers, trying again when another thread swapped in one of its own first. An observable nobody has subscribed to is one 24-byte object instead of 416 bytes, its own `IMonitor` included, which matters to code that gives each of a great many objects one, such as every `Taggregate`. Notifying the subscribers no longer allocates.",
